00:43:01,603 --> 00:43:06,103
のじゃ！連打！
Take that! Rapid clicking!

605
00:43:09,103 --> 00:43:13,103
だって夏休み 1日... 1日で... 1日で夏休みなんて！
I mean, summer vacation for just one... just one day... just one day of summer vacation is...

